  "description": "At a rural school with only two high school students, Min-Ji is sad that Ji-Hun, who is only concerned with studying, says he will leave for the city. One day, a transfer student, Yu-Jin, appears in the classroom where it was just the two of them..?! \n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated)\n\n*Note: Originally published on Manhwakyung until its shutdown, later re-published on Naver on 2025.06.26.*",
